= Hermann Molkenbuhr

Molkenbuhr is [? if chancellor = "Molkenbuhr": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Molkenbuhr": the current President and ?] a long-serving Parliamentarian, first elected in 1893, and one of the founding fathers of the modern SPD.

