@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

@america
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: resources += 1; advisor_action_timer = 6;
go-to: international_relations.america

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Molkenbuhr" : Molkenbuhr must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Molkenbuhr")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@debug_never
title: DEBUG: Never
subtitle: Never = 1
view-if: legislature_enabled
on-arrival: never = 1

Never enabled

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Molkenbuhr can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Molkenbuhr"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Molkenbuhr can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Molkenbuhr"

